<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Get Your Wish (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859256"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:23.224"><div begin="9.118" end="5:23.224"><p begin="9.118" end="11.734" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.118" end="9.341">&quot;I’ll</span> <span begin="9.341" end="9.660">make</span> <span begin="9.660" end="9.968">it</span> <span begin="9.968" end="10.733">right</span> <span begin="11.056" end="11.253">a</span><span begin="11.253" end="11.734">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“我再怎么让一切重回当初</span></p><p begin="11.734" end="14.198" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.734" end="11.964">But</span> <span begin="11.964" end="12.303">it’s</span> <span begin="12.303" end="12.588">no</span> <span begin="12.588" end="13.266">use</span><span begin="13.266" end="13.266">,&quot;</span> <span begin="13.443" end="13.601">you</span> <span begin="13.601" end="14.198">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也已无力回天了”你说</span></p><p begin="14.523" end="18.608" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.523" end="14.718">As</span> <span begin="14.718" end="15.195">my</span> <span begin="15.195" end="15.788">hun</span><span begin="15.788" end="16.423">ger</span> <span begin="16.423" end="17.102">grows</span> <span begin="17.102" end="17.548">and</span> <span begin="17.548" end="18.608">grows</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即便我的渴望 仍旧日与俱增</span></p><p begin="19.243" end="23.745" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.243" end="19.518">I</span> <span begin="19.518" end="19.742">have</span> <span begin="19.742" end="20.050">to</span> <span begin="20.050" end="20.830">write</span> <span begin="21.138" end="21.342">the</span> <span begin="21.342" end="21.645">mea</span><span begin="21.645" end="21.943">ning</span> <span begin="21.943" end="22.272">of</span> <span begin="22.272" end="22.572">my</span> <span begin="22.572" end="23.745">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我有必要书写下人生的意义</span></p><p begin="24.615" end="28.243" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.615" end="24.780">Or</span> <span begin="24.780" end="25.293">else</span> <span begin="25.293" end="25.930">e</span><span begin="25.930" end="26.508">very</span><span begin="26.508" end="27.180">thing’s</span> <span begin="27.180" end="27.650">in</span> <span begin="27.650" end="28.243">vain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">否则一切只是徒劳而已</span></p><p begin="29.623" end="34.323" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.623" end="29.980">When</span> <span begin="29.980" end="30.318">the</span> <span begin="30.318" end="30.965">glo</span><span begin="30.965" end="31.483">ry</span> <span begin="31.483" end="32.244">tries</span> <span begin="32.244" end="33.063">to</span> <span begin="33.063" end="33.840">tempt</span> <span begin="33.840" end="34.323">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="34.785" end="39.489" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.785" end="35.077">When</span> <span begin="35.077" end="35.362">the</span> <span begin="35.362" end="36.046">glo</span><span begin="36.046" end="36.568">ry</span> <span begin="36.568" end="37.265">tries</span> <span begin="37.265" end="37.864">to</span> <span begin="37.864" end="39.010">tempt</span> <span begin="39.010" end="39.489">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="39.830" end="45.651" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.830" end="40.113">When</span> <span begin="40.113" end="40.438">the</span> <span begin="40.438" end="41.092">glo</span><span begin="41.092" end="41.690">ry</span> <span begin="41.690" end="42.317">tries</span> <span begin="42.317" end="42.953">to</span> <span begin="42.953" end="44.051">tempt</span> <span begin="44.051" end="45.651">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="1:09.710" end="1:12.313" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.710" end="1:09.968">&quot;I’ll</span> <span begin="1:09.968" end="1:10.250">make</span> <span begin="1:10.250" end="1:10.625">it</span> <span begin="1:10.625" end="1:11.337">right</span> <span begin="1:11.660" end="1:11.829">a</span><span begin="1:11.829" end="1:12.313">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“我再怎么让一切重回当初</span></p><p begin="1:12.313" end="1:14.935" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.313" end="1:12.440">But</span> <span begin="1:12.440" end="1:12.799">it’s</span> <span begin="1:12.799" end="1:13.125">no</span> <span begin="1:13.125" end="1:13.848">use,&quot;</span> <span begin="1:14.055" end="1:14.330">you</span> <span begin="1:14.330" end="1:14.935">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也已无力回天了”你说</span></p><p begin="1:15.114" end="1:19.296" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.114" end="1:15.277">As</span> <span begin="1:15.277" end="1:15.748">my</span> <span begin="1:15.748" end="1:16.358">hun</span><span begin="1:16.358" end="1:17.015">ger</span> <span begin="1:17.015" end="1:17.699">grows</span> <span begin="1:17.699" end="1:18.184">and</span> <span begin="1:18.184" end="1:18.982">grow</span><span begin="1:18.982" end="1:19.296">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即便我的渴望 仍旧日与俱增</span></p><p begin="1:19.782" end="1:24.595" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.782" end="1:20.058">I</span> <span begin="1:20.058" end="1:20.358">have</span> <span begin="1:20.358" end="1:20.663">to</span> <span begin="1:20.663" end="1:21.790">write</span> <span begin="1:21.790" end="1:21.955">the</span> <span begin="1:21.955" end="1:22.283">mea</span><span begin="1:22.283" end="1:22.557">ning</span> <span begin="1:22.557" end="1:22.890">of</span> <span begin="1:22.890" end="1:23.222">my</span> <span begin="1:23.222" end="1:24.595">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我有必要书写下人生的意义</span></p><p begin="1:25.342" end="1:28.963" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.342" end="1:25.446">Or</span> <span begin="1:25.446" end="1:25.887">else</span> <span begin="1:25.887" end="1:26.530">e</span><span begin="1:26.530" end="1:27.148">very</span><span begin="1:27.148" end="1:27.845">thing’s</span> <span begin="1:27.845" end="1:28.287">in</span> <span begin="1:28.287" end="1:28.963">vain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">否则一切只是徒劳而已</span></p><p begin="1:30.193" end="1:35.032" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.193" end="1:30.601">When</span> <span begin="1:30.601" end="1:30.925">the</span> <span begin="1:30.925" end="1:31.548">glo</span><span begin="1:31.548" end="1:32.108">ry</span> <span begin="1:32.108" end="1:32.870">tries</span> <span begin="1:32.870" end="1:33.632">to</span> <span begin="1:33.632" end="1:34.495">tempt</span> <span begin="1:34.495" end="1:35.032">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="1:35.360" end="1:39.070" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.360" end="1:35.685">It</span> <span begin="1:35.685" end="1:36.005">may</span> <span begin="1:36.005" end="1:36.703">seem</span> <span begin="1:36.703" end="1:37.280">like</span> <span begin="1:37.280" end="1:37.715">what</span> <span begin="1:37.715" end="1:38.174">you</span> <span begin="1:38.174" end="1:39.070">need</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">似乎完美贴合你所需</span></p><p begin="1:40.389" end="1:42.742" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.389" end="1:40.589">But</span> <span begin="1:40.589" end="1:40.920">if</span> <span begin="1:40.920" end="1:41.379">glo</span><span begin="1:41.379" end="1:41.507">ry</span> <span begin="1:41.507" end="1:41.913">makes</span> <span begin="1:41.913" end="1:42.180">you</span> <span begin="1:42.180" end="1:42.419">hap</span><span begin="1:42.419" end="1:42.742">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果它真能使你开心</span></p><p begin="1:42.742" end="1:45.684" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.742" end="1:43.080">Why</span> <span begin="1:43.080" end="1:43.403">are</span> <span begin="1:43.403" end="1:43.873">you</span> <span begin="1:43.873" end="1:44.222">so</span> <span begin="1:44.222" end="1:44.472">bro</span><span begin="1:44.472" end="1:44.782">ken</span> <span begin="1:44.782" end="1:45.684">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为何你如今还是失魂落魄呢</span></p><p begin="1:51.780" end="1:53.735" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.780" end="1:52.437">So</span> <span begin="1:52.437" end="1:53.097">tell</span> <span begin="1:53.097" end="1:53.735">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="1:53.735" end="1:58.753" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.735" end="1:54.336">How</span> <span begin="1:54.336" end="1:54.704">it</span> <span begin="1:54.704" end="1:55.652">felt</span> <span begin="1:55.927" end="1:56.062">when</span> <span begin="1:56.062" end="1:56.194">you</span> <span begin="1:56.194" end="1:56.824">walked</span> <span begin="1:56.824" end="1:57.402">on</span> <span begin="1:57.402" end="1:58.069">wa</span><span begin="1:58.069" end="1:58.753">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漫步水上的感受如何</span></p><p begin="1:58.753" end="2:02.207" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.753" end="1:59.226">Did</span> <span begin="1:59.226" end="1:59.647">you</span> <span begin="1:59.647" end="2:00.519">get</span> <span begin="2:00.519" end="2:01.144">your</span> <span begin="2:01.144" end="2:02.207">wish?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否如愿以偿</span></p><p begin="2:02.474" end="2:04.784" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.474" end="2:02.949">Floa</span><span begin="2:02.949" end="2:03.219">ting</span> <span begin="2:03.219" end="2:03.457">to</span> <span begin="2:03.457" end="2:03.750">the</span> <span begin="2:03.750" end="2:04.283">sur</span><span begin="2:04.283" end="2:04.784">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你越想下沉</span></p><p begin="2:05.039" end="2:07.439" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.039" end="2:05.389">Qui</span><span begin="2:05.389" end="2:05.696">cker</span> <span begin="2:05.696" end="2:05.954">than</span> <span begin="2:05.954" end="2:06.252">you</span> <span begin="2:06.252" end="2:07.035">san</span><span begin="2:07.035" end="2:07.439">k</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却越难抵上浮</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:08.131" end="2:12.482"><span begin="2:08.131" end="2:08.766">(I</span><span begin="2:08.766" end="2:09.691">dol</span> <span begin="2:10.576" end="2:11.381">i</span><span begin="2:11.381" end="2:12.482">dol)</span></span></p><p begin="2:12.114" end="2:13.966" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.114" end="2:12.606">So</span> <span begin="2:12.606" end="2:13.276">tell</span> <span begin="2:13.276" end="2:13.966">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="2:13.966" end="2:18.910" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.966" end="2:14.548">How</span> <span begin="2:14.548" end="2:14.820">it</span> <span begin="2:14.820" end="2:15.786">felt</span> <span begin="2:16.111" end="2:16.263">when</span> <span begin="2:16.263" end="2:16.436">you</span> <span begin="2:16.436" end="2:17.018">walked</span> <span begin="2:17.018" end="2:17.653">on</span> <span begin="2:17.653" end="2:18.354">wa</span><span begin="2:18.354" end="2:18.910">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漫步水上的感受如何</span></p><p begin="2:18.910" end="2:22.383" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.910" end="2:19.418">Did</span> <span begin="2:19.418" end="2:19.845">you</span> <span begin="2:19.845" end="2:20.781">get</span> <span begin="2:20.781" end="2:21.418">your</span> <span begin="2:21.418" end="2:22.383">wish?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否如愿以偿？</span></p><p begin="2:22.683" end="2:25.027" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.683" end="2:23.093">Floa</span><span begin="2:23.093" end="2:23.352">ting</span> <span begin="2:23.352" end="2:23.643">to</span> <span begin="2:23.643" end="2:23.963">the</span> <span begin="2:23.963" end="2:24.478">sur</span><span begin="2:24.478" end="2:25.027">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你越想下沉</span></p><p begin="2:25.227" end="2:27.955" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.227" end="2:25.591">Qui</span><span begin="2:25.591" end="2:25.884">cker</span> <span begin="2:25.884" end="2:26.178">than</span> <span begin="2:26.178" end="2:26.503">you</span> <span begin="2:26.503" end="2:27.477">san</span><span begin="2:27.477" end="2:27.955">k</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却越难抵上浮</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:28.380" end="2:32.505"><span begin="2:28.380" end="2:29.017">(I</span><span begin="2:29.017" end="2:29.845">dol</span> <span begin="2:30.880" end="2:31.593">i</span><span begin="2:31.593" end="2:32.505">dol)</span></span></p><p begin="2:43.200" end="2:45.794" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.200" end="2:43.475">Don’t</span> <span begin="2:43.475" end="2:43.752">say</span> <span begin="2:43.752" end="2:44.055">you</span> <span begin="2:44.055" end="2:44.832">lose</span> <span begin="2:45.132" end="2:45.245">just</span> <span begin="2:45.245" end="2:45.794">yet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻 你还不能认输</span></p><p begin="2:45.794" end="2:48.609" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.794" end="2:45.975">Get</span> <span begin="2:45.975" end="2:46.278">up</span> <span begin="2:46.278" end="2:46.587">and</span> <span begin="2:46.587" end="2:47.363">move</span> <span begin="2:47.688" end="2:47.835">a</span><span begin="2:47.835" end="2:48.609">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">站起来 昂首前行</span></p><p begin="2:48.609" end="2:52.428" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.609" end="2:48.918">And</span> <span begin="2:48.918" end="2:49.245">not</span> <span begin="2:49.245" end="2:49.843">on</span><span begin="2:49.843" end="2:50.478">ly</span> <span begin="2:50.478" end="2:51.103">for</span> <span begin="2:51.103" end="2:51.630">your</span><span begin="2:51.630" end="2:52.428">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这不仅仅是为了你自己</span></p><p begin="2:53.265" end="2:55.226" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.265" end="2:53.584">‘Cause</span> <span begin="2:53.584" end="2:53.857">that’s</span> <span begin="2:53.857" end="2:54.157">your</span> <span begin="2:54.157" end="2:55.226">role</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为你所扮演的角色</span></p><p begin="2:55.226" end="2:57.593" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.226" end="2:55.414">The</span> <span begin="2:55.414" end="2:55.715">work</span> <span begin="2:55.715" end="2:56.022">that</span> <span begin="2:56.022" end="2:56.364">stirred</span> <span begin="2:56.364" end="2:56.647">your</span> <span begin="2:56.647" end="2:57.593">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">要以荡涤灵魂为职责</span></p><p begin="2:58.718" end="3:02.545" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.718" end="2:59.033">You</span> <span begin="2:59.033" end="2:59.336">can</span> <span begin="2:59.336" end="2:59.950">make</span> <span begin="2:59.950" end="3:00.596">for</span> <span begin="3:00.596" end="3:01.180">some</span><span begin="3:01.180" end="3:01.653">one</span> <span begin="3:01.653" end="3:02.545">else</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你也可以这么为他人付出</span></p><p begin="3:03.288" end="3:07.738" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.288" end="3:03.626">One</span> <span begin="3:03.626" end="3:03.908">day</span> <span begin="3:03.908" end="3:04.216">you</span> <span begin="3:04.216" end="3:05.081">choke</span> <span begin="3:05.364" end="3:05.518">your</span> <span begin="3:05.518" end="3:05.791">ur</span><span begin="3:05.791" end="3:06.161">ges</span> <span begin="3:06.161" end="3:06.455">o</span><span begin="3:06.455" end="3:06.766">ver</span><span begin="3:06.766" end="3:07.738">flow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有一天 你满心的欲望 使你窒息</span></p><p begin="3:08.808" end="3:12.528" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.808" end="3:09.075">And</span> <span begin="3:09.075" end="3:09.373">ob</span><span begin="3:09.373" end="3:10.014">ses</span><span begin="3:10.014" end="3:10.628">sion</span> <span begin="3:10.628" end="3:11.308">wears</span> <span begin="3:11.308" end="3:11.854">you</span> <span begin="3:11.854" end="3:12.528">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而痴狂 消磨光你的意志</span></p><p begin="3:13.391" end="3:18.211" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.391" end="3:13.693">But</span> <span begin="3:13.693" end="3:14.027">don’t</span> <span begin="3:14.027" end="3:14.338">you</span> <span begin="3:14.338" end="3:15.224">waste</span> <span begin="3:15.421" end="3:15.589">the</span> <span begin="3:15.589" end="3:15.892">suf</span><span begin="3:15.892" end="3:16.224">fering</span> <span begin="3:16.224" end="3:16.871">you’ve</span> <span begin="3:16.871" end="3:18.211">faced</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但不要徒劳了你一路走来的磨难</span></p><p begin="3:18.863" end="3:22.619" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.863" end="3:19.193">It</span> <span begin="3:19.193" end="3:19.495">will</span> <span begin="3:19.495" end="3:20.266">serve</span> <span begin="3:20.266" end="3:20.781">you</span> <span begin="3:20.781" end="3:21.366">in</span> <span begin="3:21.366" end="3:21.886">due</span> <span begin="3:21.886" end="3:22.619">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">它会在关键时刻有所裨益</span></p><p begin="3:22.739" end="3:26.557" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.739" end="3:23.326">So</span> <span begin="3:23.326" end="3:23.969">tell</span> <span begin="3:23.969" end="3:24.617">me</span> <span begin="3:24.617" end="3:25.245">how</span> <span begin="3:25.245" end="3:25.474">it</span> <span begin="3:25.474" end="3:26.557">felt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="3:26.773" end="3:29.589" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.773" end="3:26.921">When</span> <span begin="3:26.921" end="3:27.098">you</span> <span begin="3:27.098" end="3:27.714">walked</span> <span begin="3:27.714" end="3:28.336">on</span> <span begin="3:28.336" end="3:28.989">wa</span><span begin="3:28.989" end="3:29.589">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漫步水上的感受如何</span></p><p begin="3:29.589" end="3:33.057" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:29.589" end="3:30.092">Did</span> <span begin="3:30.092" end="3:30.533">you</span> <span begin="3:30.533" end="3:31.612">get</span> <span begin="3:31.612" end="3:32.150">your</span> <span begin="3:32.150" end="3:33.057">wish?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否如愿以偿</span></p><p begin="3:33.377" end="3:35.921" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.377" end="3:33.795">Floa</span><span begin="3:33.795" end="3:34.095">ting</span> <span begin="3:34.095" end="3:34.352">to</span> <span begin="3:34.352" end="3:34.635">the</span> <span begin="3:34.635" end="3:35.175">sur</span><span begin="3:35.175" end="3:35.921">f