3.573">need</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">似乎完美贴合你所需</span></p><p begin="4:24.668" end="4:26.999" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:24.668" end="4:24.881">But</span> <span begin="4:24.881" end="4:25.176">if</span> <span begin="4:25.176" end="4:25.603">glo</span><span begin="4:25.603" end="4:25.751">ry</span> <span begin="4:25.751" end="4:26.061">makes</span> <span begin="4:26.061" end="4:26.376">you</span> <span begin="4:26.376" end="4:26.716">hap</span><span begin="4:26.716" end="4:26.999">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果它真能使你开心</span></p><p begin="4:26.999" end="4:29.883" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:26.999" end="4:27.306">Why</span> <span begin="4:27.306" end="4:27.633">are</span> <span begin="4:27.633" end="4:28.111">you</span> <span begin="4:28.111" end="4:28.424">so</span> <span begin="4:28.424" end="4:28.765">bro</span><span begin="4:28.765" end="4:29.066">ken</span> <span begin="4:29.066" end="4:29.883">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为何你如今还是失魂落魄呢</span></p><p begin="4:40.976" end="4:42.744" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:40.976" end="4:41.672">So</span> <span begin="4:41.672" end="4:42.284">tell</span> <span begin="4:42.284" end="4:42.744">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="4:42.898" end="4:47.764" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:42.898" end="4:43.544">How</span> <span begin="4:43.544" end="4:43.785">it</span> <span begin="4:43.785" end="4:44.904">felt</span> <span begin="4:45.114" end="4:45.265">when</span> <span begin="4:45.265" end="4:45.433">you</span> <span begin="4:45.433" end="4:46.047">walked</span> <span begin="4:46.047" end="4:46.669">on</span> <span begin="4:46.669" end="4:47.330">wa</span><span begin="4:47.330" end="4:47.764">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漫步水上的感受如何</span></p><p begin="4:47.956" end="4:51.286" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="